{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18301260","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18301260","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1830126001:0":{"text":"お客さん、お目が高い！これらはどれもブライトから取り寄せた花でしてね。命日の贈り物にうってつけですよ！","source_cn":"客人真是慧眼识珠啊！这些可都是从耀光帝国进口的花，最适...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE7A6AE22BC65BDE5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"お客さん、お目が高い！これらはどれもブライトから取り寄せた花でしてね。命日の贈り物にうってつけですよ！","female":"お客さん、お目が高い！これらはどれもブライトから取り寄せた花でしてね。命日の贈り物にうってつけですよ！","variant_male_record_index":"248318","variant_female_record_index":"248319","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1830126002:1":{"text":"特に密航者の間で評判でしてね。ほら、彼らは亡くなった家族や友人に花束を贈るのが好きでしょ！","source_cn":"那些偷渡者都喜欢给自己死去的亲朋好友送上一束！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x68999079B74A1E33","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"特に密航者の間で評判でしてね。ほら、彼らは亡くなった家族や友人に花束を贈るのが好きでしょ！","female":"特に密航者の間で評判でしてね。ほら、彼らは亡くなった家族や友人に花束を贈るのが好きでしょ！","variant_male_record_index":"248320","variant_female_record_index":"248321","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830126003:1":{"text":"この花、一輪だといくらなんだ？","source_cn":"你这一朵卖多少？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BA6A780B5DD658B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1830126004:1":{"text":"一輪なら、たったの千黒鉄貨ですよ！","source_cn":"一朵只要一千黑铁币！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14BE5C8BE1D5C64B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1830126005:1":{"text":"千だって！？ぼっ